<section class="n-bg-white" aria-labelledby="title-h">
<div class="n-wrap" style="padding-top:clamp(28px,4vw,60px)">
<div class="n-open">
<div>
<div class="n-label">Our story</div>
<h1 class="n-display" id="title-h" style="margin-top:14px;font-size:clamp(2.5rem,1.8rem + 3.4vw,5.25rem);line-height:.96;max-width:18ch;color:var(--n-evergreen)">The railroad shaped the Niwot we know.</h1>
</div>
{#- The source aerial is oversaturated and only 547px wide; it is desaturated
    to match the documentary treatment and never displayed wider than ~500px. -#}
<figure style="margin:0">
{% photo "old-town-aerial.jpg", "Aerial view of Niwot in autumn showing the commercial buildings, the street grid and the farmland and rail corridor beyond", "(max-width: 900px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width: 1440px) 34vw, 480px", "display:block;width:100%;height:clamp(200px,22vw,320px);object-fit:cover;object-position:center 50%;filter:saturate(.68) contrast(.96) brightness(1.02)", true %}
<figcaption class="n-cap">The grid, the corridor and the fields it was built to serve</figcaption>
</figure>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="n-bg-white" aria-label="Introduction">
<div class="n-wrap" style="padding-top:clamp(28px,3.5vw,56px);padding-bottom:clamp(32px,4vw,64px)">
<div class="n-read">
<p class="n-lead" style="margin:0">Niwot exists because a rail line was built through the Left Hand valley in the 1870s. The town plat was recorded in 1875, and the street grid still follows the tracks rather than the county roads that came later. The brick block on Second Avenue is what remains of that decision.</p>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:22px 0 0">It has never been an incorporated municipality. There is no mayor and no town hall, which is part of why the place feels the way it does: what happens here is organized by the people who live here, through the business association, the arts groups and the neighbors who show up.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="n-bg-white n-pad" aria-labelledby="tl-h">
<div class="n-wrap">
<div class="n-shead" style="border-bottom-color:var(--n-evergreen)">
<div class="n-label">Timeline</div>
<h2 class="n-h2" id="tl-h" style="color:var(--n-evergreen)">How the community got here</h2>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:0;max-width:72ch">Each entry names what it rests on and links to it where it is online. Where a date is contested or unverified, it says so rather than carrying an approximation.</p>
</div>
<ol style="list-style:none;margin:clamp(24px,3vw,44px) 0 0;padding:0">
{%- for e in eras %}
<li class="n-era" style="padding:clamp(22px,2.8vw,40px) 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--n-rule)">
<div>
<div class="n-num" style="font-size:clamp(1.5rem,1.2rem + 1.3vw,2.5rem)">{{ e.when }}</div>
{%- if e.sourceHref %}
<a class="n-label n-label--quiet" href="{{ e.sourceHref }}" rel="noopener" style="display:inline-block;margin-top:10px;font-size:12px;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid currentColor">{{ e.source }} <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a>
{%- else %}
<div class="n-label n-label--quiet" style="margin-top:10px;font-size:12px">{{ e.source }}</div>
{%- endif %}
</div>
<div>
<h3 class="n-h3" style="color:var(--n-evergreen)">{{ e.title }}</h3>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:12px 0 0;max-width:66ch">{{ e.body }}</p>
</div>
</li>
{%- endfor %}
</ol>
</div>
</section>

<section class="n-bg-green n-pad" aria-labelledby="today-h">
<div class="n-wrap">
<div class="n-g2-wide">
<div>
<div class="n-label">Niwot today</div>
<h2 class="n-h2" id="today-h" style="margin-top:12px;max-width:18ch">A community of about four thousand people.</h2>
</div>
<div>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:0;max-width:62ch;color:var(--n-paper)">Two commercial clusters, a historic district, and farmland that starts where the sidewalks stop. Services come from Boulder County and a set of special districts rather than a town government, and in November 2026 residents inside a proposed boundary vote on whether that should change.</p>
<div class="n-btns" style="margin-top:24px">
<a class="n-btn" href="/civic/incorporation-election/">The 2026 election</a>
<a class="n-btn n-btn--ghost" href="/community/">Community organizations</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="n-bg-white" id="sources" aria-labelledby="src-h" style="padding-block:clamp(44px,6vw,104px)">
<div class="n-wrap">
<div class="n-g2-wide">
<div>
<div class="n-label">Sources and corrections</div>
<h2 class="n-h2" id="src-h" style="margin-top:12px;font-size:clamp(1.5rem,1.2rem + 1.2vw,2.25rem);max-width:18ch;color:var(--n-evergreen)">Editorial standards</h2>
</div>
<div>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:0;max-width:66ch">Population is the 2020 census figure for the Niwot census designated place. Historical dates come from the Niwot Historical Society&#8217;s timeline and the recorded town plat; the caboose&#8217;s identity and date from the Niwot Cultural Arts Association&#8217;s Whistle Stop Park page. Each timeline entry links to its source.</p>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:18px 0 0;max-width:66ch">If something here is wrong, it is corrected with the date and a note describing what changed. A claim that cannot be supported is removed rather than softened. Every correction published on this site is listed below.</p>
<h3 class="n-label n-label--quiet" id="corrections" style="margin:24px 0 0">Corrections and changes</h3>
{%- if corrections.length %}
<dl data-corrections style="margin:8px 0 0;max-width:66ch">
{%- for c in corrections %}
<div style="padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--n-rule)">
<dt class="n-label n-label--quiet" style="font-size:12px">{{ c.date | humanDate }} &#183; <a href="{{ c.page }}" style="color:inherit">{{ c.page }}</a></dt>
<dd class="n-body" style="margin:6px 0 0;font-size:.9375rem">{{ c.summary }}</dd>
</div>
{%- endfor %}
</dl>
{%- else %}
<p class="n-body" data-corrections-none style="margin:8px 0 0;max-width:66ch">No corrections have been published yet.</p>
{%- endif %}
<div class="n-btns" style="margin-top:24px">
<a class="n-btn" href="/plan-a-visit/#contact">Report a correction</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
